_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17625587227162_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><h1 style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:115%; text-align:center; font-weight:normal; font-family: 'Rethink Sans', Arial\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #98f387;\">PRESS RELEASE</span></h1></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:10px 20px 30px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17625587227163\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17625587227163_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><h1 style=\"margin:0; font-size:30px; line-height:125%; text-align:center; font-family: 'Rethink Sans', Arial\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">GreenStreetAI™ Expands Its MCP Server with Green Street News and<br>New Packaged Workflows</span></h1></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if gte mso 9]></table><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></td><![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></tr></table><![endif]-->\n\n    </div>\n   \n  </div>\n  <div id=\"section-1\" class=\"hse-section\" style=\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:10px\">\n\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"hse-column-container\" style=\"min-width:280px; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#FBFBFA; padding-bottom:20px\" bgcolor=\"#FBFBFA\">\n    \n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n      <table align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#FBFBFA\">\n      <tr style=\"background-color:#FBFBFA;\">\n    <![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:600px;padding-bottom:20px;\">\n<![endif]-->\n<!--[if gte mso 9]>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px\">\n<![endif]-->\n<div id=\"column-1-0\" class=\"hse-column hse-size-12\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:25px 30px 10px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_175746123942239\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_175746123942239_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #04504f;\">Newport Beach, California</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #04504f;\">October 13, 2026</span><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\"><em>News adds trusted context to every prompt, while new workflows deliver consistent, ready-to-use Green Street intelligence.&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\"><span style=\"color: #49b065;\"><a href=\"https://www.greenstreet.com/?utm_source=hubspot&amp;utm_medium=email-alerts&amp;utm_campaign=GreenStreetAI&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=press-release\" style=\"color:#49b065\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"0\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"euFfKMr7\" target=\"_blank\">Green Street</a></span>, the leading provider of Real Assets intelligence, data, news, and predictive analytics, today announced two significant expansions to its MCP (Model Context Protocol) Server: the launch of News, which is live now, and the introduction of new MCP workflows designed to help clients get even more value from their Green Street MCP experience inside Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, and other AI platforms.<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold\" align=\"left\"><em><span style=\"color: #162331;\">News brings context to every prompt.&nbsp;</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\"><span style=\"color: #49b065;\"><a href=\"https://www.greenstreet.com/products/news/?utm_source=hubspot&amp;utm_medium=email-alerts&amp;utm_campaign=GreenStreetAI&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=press-release\" style=\"color:#49b065\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"0\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"GV181AwI\" target=\"_blank\">Green Street News</a></span> is the leading global commercial real estate (CRE) news source, delivering breaking stories across the UK, EU, Australia, Canada, and the U.S. With the News tool, users can ask natural-language questions about Green Street News coverage and receive a synthesized answer with a link back to the full article on the Green Street platform. For clients already using Green Street’s existing MCP connectors, News adds a valuable layer of context to every prompt. Whether a question draws on Research, Company Data, Market Data, Forecasts, or Sales Comps, News brings in the developments, transactions, and market activity behind the numbers, so that answers are more complete and better informed.</span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:10px 20px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module-0-0-4\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse:separate;\">\n    <tbody><tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#49B065\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; border-radius:23px; cursor:auto; background-color:#49B065; mso-padding-alt:12px 24px\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.greenstreet.com/greenstreetai-expands-its-mcp-server-with-green-street-news-and-new-packaged-workflows/?utm_source=hubspot&amp;utm_medium=email-alerts&amp;utm_campaign=GreenStreetAI&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=press-release\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00a4bd; font-size:16px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; Margin:0; text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0px; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 24px; display:block\" data-hs-link-id=\"0\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"BO/tQuV5\">\n          <strong style=\"colo